---
// Coverage paths — three tall tinted tiles, each with its own CTA button.
// The buttons are outline capsules, not gold: gold stays reserved for the
// primary actions (call Lisa, get help, compare plans), and three gold pills in
// one row would flatten that hierarchy. No prices anywhere.
//
// No arrow glyphs in the labels: the self-hosted Open Sans is a latin subset
// with no U+2191/U+2193, so they rendered as missing-glyph boxes.
---

<section class="section" id="coverage" aria-labelledby="coverage-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Coverage</p>

    <div class="section-intro">
      <h2 id="coverage-heading">What I can help you with.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="cards cards--3 cards--tiles">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Medicare</h3>
        <p>Supplement, Advantage, and Part D — explained simply, chosen carefully.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#medicare">See the short version</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Dental &amp; Vision</h3>
        <p>Compare top carriers and enroll online today, in 43 states.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#dental">Start today</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Protecting the rest</h3>
        <p>Life insurance and cancer, heart attack &amp; stroke plans, when you’re ready.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#contact">Ask me</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
